# Nunes AI - Sibyl-memory-gated financial agent on Base

Copy to `.env` and fill in. Everything is optional except when you want real
onchain settlement (without it the agent runs in simulation mode).

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

| Variable | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `BASE_RPC_URL` | Base Sepolia RPC (e.g. `https://sepolia.base.org`). Set to send real txs. |
| `BASE_PRIVATE_KEY` | Private key of the agent's Base wallet. Funded with USDC + ETH on Sepolia. |
| `USDC_ADDRESS` | Defaults to USDC on Base Sepolia. |
| `NUNES_AI_SIMULATE` | `1` forces simulated txs even when RPC/key are set (safe for demos). |
| `NUNES_AI_MEMORY_DB` | Overrides the Sibyl memory database path (default `~/.sibyl-memory/nunes-ai.db`). |

Never commit a real `.env`.
